{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1102","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Balanced Ternary String"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ consisting of exactly $$$n$$$ characters, and each character is either '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. Such strings are called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ternary strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"replace minimum number of characters"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in this string with other characters to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ternary string ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ternary string is a ternary string such that the number of characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' in this string is equal to the number of characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', and the number of characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' obviously) is equal to the number of characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"')."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Among all possible "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ternary strings you have to obtain the lexicographically (alphabetically) smallest."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that you can neither remove characters from the string nor add characters to the string. Also note that you can replace the given characters only with characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"guaranteed"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" that the answer exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$3 \\le n \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$n$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"divisible by $$$3$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of characters in $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains the string $$$s$$$ consisting of exactly $$$n$$$ characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one string — the lexicographically (alphabetically) smallest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" ternary string which can be obtained from the given one with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of replacements."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Because $$$n$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"divisible by $$$3$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" it is obvious that the answer exists. And it is obvious that there is only one possible answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n121\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n021\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n001122\n"}],"kin